OL,3,AGCSE pass rate falls slightly as top
OL,4,Agrades edge up across England, Wales
OL,5,Aand Northern Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe GCSE overall pass rate has fallen
OL,8,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,9,Fbut top grades have edged up across
OL,10,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland
OL,12,FHundreds of thousands of students are
OL,13,Fopening their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,14,FNationals results - you can watch live
OL,15,Fat the top of the page
OL,17,FThe gap between the pass rates for boys
OL,18,Fand girls across all three nations has
OL,19,Fnarrowed again, to its lowest point
OL,20,Fsince 2000
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
